{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第二天結束，第三天也順利考完了。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……還是會累呢。」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4092", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理也累了。」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": "sk1002", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天的數學盡是考需要漫長計算的題目。希望能出點動腦的類型。」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4093", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「疲累的原因跟大家不同次元……」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 217, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，這樣就只剩下明天而已了呢。」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": "mu0428", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看見希望的光芒了。明天終於要結束了，安潔！」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn0379", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是、是的、就是說啊。」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2163", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天……終於……」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2164", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 217, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嚕～？」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 220, "voice": "pn0119", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你們在臉紅什麼？」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "ht0368", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒沒沒沒沒沒沒有什麼都沒有喔是的！」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2165", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「暖氣好像開太強了……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 217, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔去拜託一下調整溫度吧！安潔要出發了，出發！」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2166", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 212, "voice": "ag2167", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安潔害羞得跑走，而我則是臉變得更紅了。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "越接近最後一天，終於要實現約定的情緒就越來越高漲。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好可疑……」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": "sk1003", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很可疑呢～」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "ht0369", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天應該是比較冷才對。」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4094", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熱戀中的人不需要暖氣呢。好環保喔，呵呵。」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 224, "voice": "mu0429", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4095", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽學姊，我們也不能輸！一起來做環保吧！」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 222, "voice": "sn0380", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嚕嚕嚕？」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 220, "voice": "pn0120", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像已經被大家（除去瀨名同學和熊喵）發現我們之間有什麼不尋常了……", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～♪」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 217, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔哈哈哈，還在裝沒事。」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 226, "voice": "ht0370", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "故作平靜的我，在某種意義上是戀愛中男生矜持的極致。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，連這種狀況也能讓人欣然接受，戀愛真的是一種罪過啊。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "總之，時間一分一秒地接近。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大概會成為我們的紀念日的那一天。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們沒有衝動進行，而是確實地一步一步做準備──", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_ange_route01_26.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為「那一天」的那個行為是如此重要，所以連此時的一分一秒都成為了醞釀出氣氛的助力。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
